``` Probe for CL-03: lists the fields /services/cluster/master/fixup level=search_factor returns on this instance.
    An error means the endpoint is not served here; run it on the instance
    named in the entry's Run on line. ```
| rest splunk_server=local /services/cluster/master/fixup level=search_factor count=1
| transpose 0
| rename column as field, "row 1" as sample_value
